  "title": "Sarens deploys new Grove rough-terrain cranes on INEOS Project ONE in Belgium",
  "summary": "Four Grove GRT8100-1 cranes and one Grove GRT780 support a major industrial construction project in Antwerp, Belgium.All the cranes were manufactured at Manitowoc’s Niella Tanaro factory in Italy.Manitowoc is providing full parts, service, and maintenance support to the cranes from its Breda facility in The Netherlands.",
